            <div xml:id="d815">

                <pb facs="0865" n="851" sameAs="frus:frus1944v07/pg851"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.76/100: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Lane</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-03-18T18:00:00-05:00">March 18, 1944—6
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 10:07 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>532. Colombian Foreign Office informs me that Radiodifusora National has
                    suspended broadcasting on 6260 kilocycles to avoid the <pb facs="0866" n="852"
                        xml:id="pg852"/> interference mentioned in Department’s telegram 326 of
                    March 11, 7 p.m.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lane</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
